# Roadmap: tidydown

## Overview

Tidydown currently provides automatic file organization via background services (launchd/systemd). This roadmap adds a manual sort command that enables users to trigger one-time reorganization of their watch folders on-demand. The journey begins with building foundational components (scanner, coordination, progress tracking), wires them together into the sort command with dry-run by default, and concludes with undo capabilities for recovery.

